    answer: "For almost everyone, no. Install the new version the same way you installed the old one and your existing appwrite.config.json, flags, scripts, and CI pipelines keep working. The one thing that does not carry over is your stored login, because credentials move to a different keyring entry. Run appwrite login once after upgrading."
